<Textbox Name="Notes"><CanGrow>true</CanGrow><KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
<Paragraphs><Paragraph><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>Source: NCUA 5300 Call Report quarterly data, 2015Q2-2026Q2. Delinquency = 60+ days past due balance / portfolio balance. Net charge-off rate = quarterly charge-offs less recoveries, annualized, over quarter-end balance. Shaded column = one-quarter-ahead forecast from a balance-weighted LightGBM model chosen on a 2022Q3-2024Q2 validation window. Test window 2024Q3-2026Q2, balance-weighted MAE (model vs. last-quarter persistence): total-loan delinquency 13.3 vs 15.7 bp; total net charge-offs 14.7 vs 16.8 bp. Industry loans granted, 2026Q3 forecast (SARIMAX with macro drivers): $180.5B (80% interval $173.3B-$188.0B). Blank cells: portfolio under $10M or outside model scope.</Value><Style><FontSize>7pt</FontSize><Color>DimGray</Color></Style></TextRun></TextRuns><Style /></Paragraph></Paragraphs>
<Top>2.75in</Top><Left>0in</Left><Height>0.6in</Height><Width>10in</Width><Style /></Textbox>
</ReportItems><Height>3.4in</Height><Style /></Body>
<Width>10in</Width>
